"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏燕","author":"区元晋","text":"双蹴芹泥香未乾，经营无过草堂安。\n呢喃似诉朱门景，帘幕风摇敛翅难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2665,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏瓜","author":"区元晋","text":"尚忆年华计及瓜，故侯老矣兴踰加。\n再从抱瓮看绵瓞，五色文成献帝家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2666,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏鱼","author":"区元晋","text":"弹铗宁因味不兼，养鱼偏爱出藏潜。\n请看鳞甲凌秋奋，九万名从小鉴添。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2667,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏梅和郑过斋老隐 其一","author":"区元晋","text":"霁霜玉笛满城头，晓探寒花劲气浮。\n恰是老梅屯雪阵，先将游骑骋清秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2668,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏梅和郑过斋老隐 其二","author":"区元晋","text":"清霜绛帐捲芙蓉，遥见文姬淡月中。\n自歛色香羞自献，肯随桃李媚春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2669,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏梅和郑过斋老隐 其三","author":"区元晋","text":"江门义口石桥东，雪后槎枒树树同。\n数点个中存一画，几人花外得神通。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2670,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏梅和郑过斋老隐 其四","author":"区元晋","text":"萧飒山堂一此君，岁寒非尔孰为群。\n双清不入繁华调，倚遍江村日暮云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2671,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏梅和郑过斋老隐 其五","author":"区元晋","text":"平林漠漠淡含烟，绕径梅花别有天。\n短发可能催白尽，一回见尔一添年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2672,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏梅和郑过斋老隐 其六","author":"区元晋","text":"抚景新诗敢自慵，冷香丛里兴无穷。\n半岩松雪才数朵，无限山林万古风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2673,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏梅和郑过斋老隐 其七","author":"区元晋","text":"夜听吹笛满空山，睡起寻梅古寺间。\n一种孤芳谁解得，漫从僧舍伴云閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2674,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"友人栽莲踰夏无花携酒雅观屡约屡移用韵戏之 其一","author":"区元晋","text":"载酒看花屡约移，种花徒早恨花迟。\n东风未必靳颜色，为报明朝着意吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2675,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"友人栽莲踰夏无花携酒雅观屡约屡移用韵戏之 其二","author":"区元晋","text":"再向耶溪认旧栽，当时歌动采莲杯。\n青尊一别娇娥远，应怪花神不早开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2676,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一拳石 其一","author":"区元晋","text":"梦里罗浮安在哉，醒看奇岫俯高台。\n自犹记得飞云顶，移动云根一片来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2677,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一拳石 其二","author":"区元晋","text":"把酒阶庭亦快哉，醉摩奇石坐山台。\n峥嵘共道多恣态，谁自元章百拜来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2678,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔","author":"区元晋","text":"舞破烟蓑影独新，百年箕谷亦尧臣。\n扁舟荡漾东西岸，钓外风云剩有春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2679,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"樵","author":"区元晋","text":"山头梓棘入肩新，幽致休论是买臣。\n归与妻孥炊伏雉，扊扅歌好不宜春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2680,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"耕","author":"区元晋","text":"万化流形陇畔新，耕莘宁复爱商臣。\n五羊皮好甘枯槁，不到翻然不作春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2681,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牧","author":"区元晋","text":"长夜歌残旦复新，未应扣角说君臣。\n拈翻宁戚当时意，牵向桃园睡晓春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2682,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荼蘼花和李贡元","author":"区元晋","text":"攒刺柔条护紫英，半开撩蝶梦难成。\n汉娥宫样新添丽，宁记金茎玉露馨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2683,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题崙山号","author":"区元晋","text":"五色祥云映日鲜，玉楼高处坐神仙。\n人间亦有登瀛客，莫把虚无说阆巅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2684,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代柬辞友人召 其一","author":"区元晋","text":"霏霏霭翠竹琅玕，一味新凉协肺肝。\n试问剥芋烹茗碗，何如江上弄渔竿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2685,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代柬辞友人召 其二","author":"区元晋","text":"水绿山光影共函，满庭秋色倩谁监。\n高秋携酒公能许，留看松杉满翠蓝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2686,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和答陈总戎远惠诗轴 其一","author":"区元晋","text":"声远题高古不如，六年再睹右军书。\n春光四壁龙蛇动，画寝能醒病宰予。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2687,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和答陈总戎远惠诗轴 其二","author":"区元晋","text":"笑尔巴声和独多，引商刻羽便蹉跎。\n几回欲答飞凫句，遗响沉吟岁又过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2688,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"论诗","author":"区元晋","text":"品格诗家枉费评，吾诗吾自遣吾情。\n可怜不识怡情者，错托宫商论浊清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2689,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新春自述 其一","author":"区元晋","text":"正喜龙飞景运新，白头击壤任微臣。\n扁舟漫说鸱夷远，绿浪红渠也自春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2690,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新春自述 其二","author":"区元晋","text":"葛巾醉裹旧还新，草莽云谁不是臣。\n欸乃数声渔浦上，九霄春落野人春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2691,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"交溪草堂山茶花发 其一","author":"区元晋","text":"看花容易放舟难，春满交溪谩倚栏。\n此日尊前开一朵，喜从连理共君看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2692,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"交溪草堂山茶花发 其二","author":"区元晋","text":"朝来扶杖绕清池，鹤顶丹成未有诗。\n少态自疑花识我，不应弦管负花知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2693,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阅思斋弟仰西亭诗感述","author":"区元晋","text":"万仞云开玉屹屏，仰屏何处是无形。\n孤儿一掬西亭念，安得岩岩借色声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2694,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谕弟罗樵息讼","author":"区元晋","text":"江平如掌雪风清，束矢钩金快此行。\n终使摘奸归帖服，已非虞芮昔时情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2695,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和罗樵弟紫菊 其一","author":"区元晋","text":"十月菩蕾紫滟新，护持元自有花神。\n金樽花底歌檀板，不向霓裳羡太真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2696,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和罗樵弟紫菊 其二","author":"区元晋","text":"一夜奇花吐海涯，洪纤群卉不须誇。\n始知仙侣滂沱雨，不长人间滟冶花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2697,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵罗明府改题姓系 其一","author":"区元晋","text":"榄水芙溪隔几岑，此心此水不如深。\n消将一掬朝宗意，再续人间杕杜吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2698,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵罗明府改题姓系 其二","author":"区元晋","text":"高阳情尽有遗思，世谱由来缉涣丝。\n但使流分源不异，宗盟聊尔释前悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2699,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"承两渠陈茂才诸君赛神祝嘏之爱口号致谢博笑","author":"区元晋","text":"纸灰飞扑篆浮烟，傩语声中字字圆。\n不负史巫纷若吉，始知儒者学通玄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2700,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七夕","author":"区元晋","text":"一曲清商酒数行，银河未落月犹明。\n欲知天上人间事，请看牵牛织女星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2701,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秫坡钓台渔矶寂寂隐仙踪，路转莺花更几重。十里水云飞不断，空教人忆钓丝风。(以上《区奉政遗稿》卷六饮万司成村庄 其一","author":"区元晋","text":"雨霁山初曙，云轻径半迷。\n醉醒凭小槛，渔笛过桥西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2702,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秫坡钓台渔矶寂寂隐仙踪，路转莺花更几重。十里水云飞不断，空教人忆钓丝风。(以上《区奉政遗稿》卷六饮万司成村庄 其二","author":"区元晋","text":"林园风气佳，欣欣物生色。\n驴背采芳归，溪清月华白。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2703,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饮郭都谏别墅 其一","author":"区元晋","text":"平林烟半昏，凉气荐山雨。\n试问春若何，流莺花外语。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":2704,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]